## CQ-FF-01 | firefly bushes in savanna, shrubland, brushland, mangrove and orchid swamps
@group server
@commands fresh world, `/locate biome` or fly through savanna, Terralith shrubland and brushland, mangrove swamp, orchid swamp; look for firefly bushes
@pass bushes found in each, plus river and swamp
@fails none found in a new biome: kubejs/data override not winning over the mod's own modifier
@reviewed 2026-11-16
@from batches/r1031/b1_gameplay.qb
> execute positioned 0 70 0 run locate biome minecraft:savanna
waitlog nearest minecraft:savanna is at 300
capture SV minecraft:savanna is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {SV1} 200 {SV3}
sleep 30
# a count box is at most 262144 blocks (64x64x64): each biome box runs as slices; its shell line sums them and fails on 0
> say FF01SV begin
> cdevtest count {SV1-48} 40 {SV3-48} {SV1+48} 140 {SV3-24} fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> cdevtest count {SV1-48} 40 {SV3-23} {SV1+48} 140 {SV3+1} fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> cdevtest count {SV1-48} 40 {SV3+2} {SV1+48} 140 {SV3+26} fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> cdevtest count {SV1-48} 40 {SV3+27} {SV1+48} 140 {SV3+48} fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> say FF01SV end
waitlog FF01SV end 120
shell python3 -I -c "import re,sys;L=open('logs/latest.log',errors='replace').read().splitlines();a=sys.argv[1];i=max([k for k,l in enumerate(L) if a+' begin' in l]+[0]);t={};[t.__setitem__(m[1],t.get(m[1],0)+int(m[2])) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count block=(\S+) n=(\d+)',l)] if m];s=sum(int(m[1]) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count .*skipped_columns=(\d+)',l)] if m);print(a,'totals',t,'skipped_columns',s);z=[b for b in sys.argv[2:] if not t.get(b)];print('zero:',z);sys.exit(1 if z else 0)" FF01SV fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> execute positioned 0 70 0 run locate biome minecraft:mangrove_swamp
waitlog nearest minecraft:mangrove_swamp is at 300
capture MS minecraft:mangrove_swamp is at \[(-?\d+), (~|-?\d+), (-?\d+)\]
> tp qa {MS1} 200 {MS3}
sleep 30
> say FF01MS begin
> cdevtest count {MS1-48} 40 {MS3-48} {MS1+48} 140 {MS3-24} fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> cdevtest count {MS1-48} 40 {MS3-23} {MS1+48} 140 {MS3+1} fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> cdevtest count {MS1-48} 40 {MS3+2} {MS1+48} 140 {MS3+26} fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> cdevtest count {MS1-48} 40 {MS3+27} {MS1+48} 140 {MS3+48} fireflybushport:firefly_bush
> say FF01MS end
waitlog FF01MS end 120
shell python3 -I -c "import re,sys;L=open('logs/latest.log',errors='replace').read().splitlines();a=sys.argv[1];i=max([k for k,l in enumerate(L) if a+' begin' in l]+[0]);t={};[t.__setitem__(m[1],t.get(m[1],0)+int(m[2])) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count block=(\S+) n=(\d+)',l)] if m];s=sum(int(m[1]) for l in L[i:] for m in [re.search(r'verb=count .*skipped_columns=(\d+)',l)] if m);print(a,'totals',t,'skipped_columns',s);z=[b for b in sys.argv[2:] if not t.get(b)];print('zero:',z);sys.exit(1 if z else 0)" FF01MS fireflybushport:firefly_bush
